### Catalog Service API Test Requests

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001

### Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Get category by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### Create category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Electronic devices and accessories"
}

### Update category
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics Updated",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### Delete category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### Get all items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items

### Get items by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items?categoryId=1&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### Get item by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1

### Create item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop",
  "description": "High-performance laptop",
  "price": 999.99,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Update item
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "price": 1099.99,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Delete item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/items/1